2026-05-10 17:17:02,257 - INFO - 1. **Flexibility and Work-Life Balance**: Remote work can offer more flexibility, allowing employees to manage personal and professional commitments more effectively.
2026-05-10 17:17:02,257 - INFO - 2. **Reduced Commuting**: Working from home can significantly reduce commuting time and costs, leading to less stress and more time for other activities.
