2026-05-10 17:34:08,892 - INFO - 
2026-05-10 17:34:08,892 - INFO - 5. **Adaptability**: Online news can quickly adapt to changes in technology and consumer behavior, such as mobile consumption and social media integration, which can help sustain and grow their audience and revenue.
2026-05-10 17:34:08,892 - INFO - 
2026-05-10 17:34:08,892 - INFO - While print newspapers have their own strengths, such as brand loyalty and a dedicated readership, the financial challenges they face, including declining circulation and higher production costs, often make online news models more sustainable and lucrative in the current media landscape.
